{
  "description": "Shared cases for the TypeScript engine (lib/) and the Swift TaxEngine (ios/TaxEngine). Inputs not listed default to 0/false, 2026, single. Expected values are compared to the cent. Every case also checks that the bracket breakdown sums to taxBeforeCredits. rothCases check the reduced Roth IRA limit (rounded up to $10, $200 minimum).",
